  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidra till delegationens arbete, s&#xe4;rskilt utvecklingssamarbetet, med s&#xe4;rskilt st&#xf6;d till fr&#xe5;gor som &#xe4;r relaterade till Team Europa-ansatsen, &#x201d;Working Better Together&#x201d; och gemensamprogrammering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the work of the Delegation, notably the Development Cooperation Section, specifically supporting all matters related to Joint Programming to follow up to the EU-Zimbabwe Roadmap for Better Working Together.</narrative>
  </description>
